     "WolframAIAssistant"|>|>,
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"376e2ec2-5b25-3d41-95aa-904bd27595e0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is a strong scaffold. Even if RHUFT is still partly conceptual, a lot \
of this notebook is ",
 StyleBox["already aligned with a serious computational architecture style",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ". \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"High-level assessment\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"68af0d7e-b445-8049-ae9a-1b47e4d39858"],
 "\nWhat looks potentially ",
 StyleBox["correct / RHUFT-aligned",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " in your old document:\n\n1. ",
 StyleBox["Layered architecture thinking",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "constants"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"896e0e68-5a69-df4b-94a0-029d85acb4f4"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "oscillator field"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"64366fec-52cb-0040-9d8c-13ca403924f9"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "topology / closure"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"92f76760-a796-0a43-b805-d5294c7f9677"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "node lattice"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"013f83cc-564d-f249-b448-f01c566ecaf1"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "self-measurement"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"c8a7f568-ebaa-ac46-93de-c31050a42f70"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "actualization / selection"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"87fe7f06-a40c-dc4f-a72a-030f751c4c00"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "diagnostics"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"f688519a-eef1-1e40-a3ac-897a5a4bbfc7"],
 "\n   That is structurally coherent and likely useful as a canonical RHUFT \
decomposition.\n\n2. ",
 StyleBox["Use of measurable observables",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "coherence"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"5b02af97-2a83-eb4d-96ad-b076b1cfd1a6"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "closure"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"762d645f-1cca-9149-9b48-5e13cfb29882"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "drift/discrepancy"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"85d6cbc1-89ba-154d-8c71-f832ed7867f8"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
