   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "burden/inertia proxy"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"da9810dd-fdbc-4244-98d8-b0038501054e"],
 "\n   This is excellent because it turns metaphysical language into testable \
quantities.\n\n3. ",
 StyleBox["State-centric design",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "the association-based engine state is one of the best parts"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"119919c3-2eef-e140-a064-518666b99a26"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  "   ",
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "RHUFT will need a canonical state object if it is to be simulated, \
validated, or refactored"
 }], "InlineSubitem",ExpressionUUID->"5692dbbd-6ffe-5242-aaf9-bf4b93ccd7cc"],
 "\n4. ",
 StyleBox["Separation of symbolic equations from executable operators",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
