 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"My current synthesis of RHUFT context from your \
notebook\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"956f7c01-0611-1741-8c11-f0267c881dcb"],
 "\nBased on this document alone, RHUFT appears to be aiming at something \
like: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox["\<\"A recursive, multiscale dynamical framework in which \
realized structure emerges and persists when oscillatory coherence, \
topological closure, memory-stabilized self-measurement, and constrained \
information burden jointly support stable actualization.\"\>",
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
          GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
      ImageMargins->5,
      ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
        LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[1], 
         GrayLevel[0.278317]]}}},
   GridBoxDividers->{"ColumnsIndexed" -> {1 -> Directive[
         LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.87, 0.94, 1], 
          RGBColor[0.2491127, 0.3295188, 0.4231198]], 
         AbsoluteThickness[4]]}, "Rows" -> {{False}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], 
  "BlockQuote",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"87154ed0-f2c2-c64d-812b-4ae589c47c1f"],
 "\nThat is actually a pretty coherent direction.\n\nI would break the \
implied RHUFT worldview into these core claims: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"RHUFT claim set, version 0\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"eb91985d-c0a2-0c4e-bb2e-58a781b212d1"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"A. Reality/state is not just static substance but organized \
recurrence\"\>", "Subsubsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"54ff3ca3-92eb-b84a-ad17-afc8cdb70bf8"],
