    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"b8cdef1b-3665-754c-bb43-cba908e540ab"],
 "\nThese parts are the most defensible and potentially RHUFT-core: \n",
