  "BlockQuote",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"1c22b107-1d9e-184f-aa7c-42c7e0d3e62d"],
 "\nis not justified unless you derive: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "where 6455 and 6456 come from,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"e9d42161-fd3f-de4e-be5e-ed4f16b44d72"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "why that ratio is unique,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"1113ba78-4de2-164a-8080-c7befdf5ac4d"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "and why no neighboring rational should be used."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"afe14485-c587-804e-9c89-8911566952ea"],
 "\nOtherwise it is a fit parameter in disguise. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"RHUFT classification\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
