   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"a5d1e100-84dd-fc48-9a60-151304988d1c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"7. \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Entropic coherence achieved\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c37f7e4e-b6a0-6244-8808-cc76ce43f3c7"],
 "\nThis is too strong.\n\nAt present, you have: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "a geometric guess for an ideal constant,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"fd07683c-d5fc-404a-bc02-76b369a47e92"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "and a ratio between that guess and experiment."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"951e56ef-6304-884a-8d86-ccaeb1a66123"],
 "\nThat is not entropic unification yet.\n\nTo make it serious, RHUFT would \
need: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
