 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"29d735eb-6537-4e47-8fe9-895283411cc6"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "a derivation of why measured electromagnetism differs from a geometric \
ideal,"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"8311a267-8eee-b74d-9f49-875935a0bebc"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "and a law relating that deviation to environmental or vacuum structure."
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"45f124cc-2fe8-1d46-9b19-0c0de7e90b50"],
 "\nRight now this is interpretive language without the derivation behind it. \
\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
