 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"10b89d86-b152-9141-84d7-835cd62e7422"],
 "\nThat one move would greatly improve the project. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
