\\\"Type\\\" -> \\\"NumericalFit\\\",\\n      \\\"RHUFTLayer\\\" -> \
\\\"Geometric Hierarchy\\\",\\n      \\\"Rationale\\\" -> \\\"The numerical \
closeness is notable, but the correction factor is not currently derived from \
