mismatch rather than deriving it dynamically.\\\",\\n      \\\"Dependencies\\\
\" -> {\\\"Validity of ideal law\\\", \\\"Meaningful definition of \
entropy/coherence deviation\\\", \\\"Physical interpretation of \
ratio\\\"},\\n      \\\"Evidence\\\" -> {\\\"A computable discrepancy ratio \
exists\\\"},\\n      \\\"ValidationPath\\\" -> {\\\"Define entropy/coherence \
