## 1. Validation Categories\n\n```wl\nClearAll[\n  validationClasses,\n  \
evidenceLevels,\n  validationStatuses,\n  validationClassStyle,\n  \
evidenceLevelOrder\n];\n\nvalidationClasses = {\n  \"Dimensional\",\n  \
